  "releaseNotes": "v2.1.2: Typed endpoints (EndpointBase<TRequest,TResponse>) now transparently bind chunked and large deferred bodies — the framework drains BodyStream before deserialization so no endpoint boilerplate is needed. string and byte[] request types receive the raw body instead of JSON-deserialized values. Added HttpRequest.ReadBodyAsync() and CountBodyBytesAsync() for endpoints that need manual body access.",
